sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Client
    participant W as WebhookController
    participant K as Kafka (meeting.events)
    participant MC as MeetingEventConsumer
    participant TS as TranscriptService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Note over C,DB: Edge case — duplicate transcript chunk (same transcriptId) → stored once

    C->>W: POST meeting.transcript (transcriptId = X)
    W->>K: publish (key = sessionId)
    W-->>C: 202 Accepted
    K->>MC: deliver
    MC->>TS: handleTranscript
    TS->>DB: existsByTranscriptId(X)?
    DB-->>TS: false
    TS->>DB: insert segment (X)

    Note over C,DB: same chunk delivered again (at-least-once redelivery)
    C->>W: POST meeting.transcript (transcriptId = X)
    W->>K: publish (key = sessionId)
    W-->>C: 202 Accepted
    K->>MC: deliver
    MC->>TS: handleTranscript
    TS->>DB: existsByTranscriptId(X)?
    DB-->>TS: true
    Note right of TS: skip (no-op). UNIQUE(transcript_id)<br/>is the race backstop
